                    "guide_contents": "<p style=\"font-weight: 700; line-height: 24px; letter-spacing: 0.05em; text-underline-position: from-font; text-decoration-skip-ink: none; color: rgb(37, 39, 41); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Kaku Gothic ProN&quot;, メイリオ, Meiryo, &quot;MS Gothic&quot;, sans-serif; margin-right: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important;\">メッセージの内容を確認してください。</p><p style=\"line-height: 24px; letter-spacing: 0.05em; text-underline-position: from-font; text-decoration-skip-ink: none; margin-right: 0px; margin-left: 0px; color: rgb(37, 39, 41); padding: 0px; font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Kaku Gothic ProN&quot;, メイリオ, Meiryo, &quot;MS Gothic&quot;, sans-serif;\">「エラーコード：401」または「その他のエラーコード」で対応が異なります。</p><p style=\"line-height: 24px; letter-spacing: 0.05em; text-underline-position: from-font; text-decoration-skip-ink: none; margin-right: 0px; margin-left: 0px; color: rgb(37, 39, 41); padding: 0px; font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Kaku Gothic ProN&quot;, メイリオ, Meiryo, &quot;MS Gothic&quot;, sans-serif;\"><br></p><p style=\"line-height: 24px; letter-spacing: 0.05em; text-underline-position: from-font; text-decoration-skip-ink: none; margin-right: 0px; margin-left: 0px; color: rgb(37, 39, 41); padding: 0px; font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Kaku Gothic ProN&quot;, メイリオ, Meiryo, &quot;MS Gothic&quot;, sans-serif;\">楽天「認証キーの期限が切れ」エラーの対応についてのガイドはこちら「<span s7-link-guide-attr=\"s7-link\" s7-link-uid=\"link-02eb08c0-271d-4123-9f82-484b820ceb3d\" class=\"s7-link-guide-attr-class\">API設定を確認</span>」</p>",
