                    "guide_contents": "<p style=\"line-height: 24px; letter-spacing: 0.05em; text-underline-position: from-font; text-decoration-skip-ink: none; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Noto Sans JP&quot;, sans-serif; margin-right: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important;\">ポータルサイトが特定事業者の場合、「取込元ID」が決められた書式ではない（桁数が異なる等）、または、空欄だと帳票印刷ができないため、</p><p style=\"line-height: 24px; letter-spacing: 0.05em; text-underline-position: from-font; text-decoration-skip-ink: none; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Noto Sans JP&quot;, sans-serif; margin-right: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important;\">その一覧が表示されております。</p><p style=\"line-height: 24px; letter-spacing: 0.05em; text-underline-position: from-font; text-decoration-skip-ink: none; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Noto Sans JP&quot;, sans-serif; margin-right: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important;\"><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Noto Sans JP, sans-serif\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.7px;\"><br></span></font></p><p style=\"line-height: 24px; letter-spacing: 0.05em; text-underline-position: from-font; text-decoration-skip-ink: none; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Noto Sans JP&quot;, sans-serif; margin-right: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important;\"><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Noto Sans JP, sans-serif\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.7px;\">対象の受付Noをクリックし、</span></font></p><p style=\"line-height: 24px; letter-spacing: 0.05em; text-underline-position: from-font; text-decoration-skip-ink: none; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Noto Sans JP&quot;, sans-serif; margin-right: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important;\"><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Noto Sans JP, sans-serif\"></font>寄附管理より「取込元ID」を確認してください。</p><p style=\"line-height: 24px; letter-spacing: 0.05em; text-underline-position: from-font; text-decoration-skip-ink: none; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Noto Sans JP&quot;, sans-serif; margin-right: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important;\">ポータルサイト側の<span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); font-family: &quot;Hiragino Kaku Gothic ProN&quot;; letter-spacing: normal;\">申込ID（寄附番号）</span>も確認して、インシデントで共有をお願いいたします。</p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Noto Sans JP&quot;, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0.05em;\">※取込元IDはWorkthyのみ変更可能なため</span><br></p>",
                    "x_coordinate": 0,
